<title>HUNGARY: BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CH'SHIP FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CH'SHIP FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's European basketball championship final played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Lithuania beat Slovakia 72-62 (halftime 30-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Lithuania - Lina Dambrauskaite 23, Jolanta Vilutyte 14, Jurgita Streimikyte 9, Reda Aleliunaite 9</p>
<p>Slovakia - Renata Hirakova 17, Milena Razgova 11, Anna Kotocova 10</p>
</text>
